{"id":"su_den","lemma":"Süden","pos":"noun","rank":1699,"glosses":["south (direction)","south (region)"],"ipa":"/ˈzyːdən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/05/De-S%C3%BCden.ogg/De-S%C3%BCden.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Südens"},"examples":[{"text":"Er kommt aus dem Süden.","en":"He comes from the south.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Diese Fenster gehen nach Süden.","en":"These windows look to the south.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/565925","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"window"},{"g":"to go, to walk"},{"g":"after / to"},null]},{"text":"Sie muss aus dem Süden kommen.","en":"She must be from the South.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to come"}]},{"text":"Die Vögel fliegen in den Süden.","en":"The birds are flying south.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"a bird","l":"Vogel"},{"g":"to fly"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Ich will im Winter in den Süden.","en":"I want to go south for the winter.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"winter"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]}]}